ure, not opportunity kind). Proposed 2026-08-16, Phase 2, not yet wired into any screen — see docs/04-Wireframes/PRODUCT-SPEC.md §D.6. Group carried in metadata.group rather than a 3rd Firestore level, per the existing sub-area/metadata convention. recording/mixing/mastering deliberately value-aligned with engineer_specialties/studio_services — different axis, same value strings, on purpose.", "is_published": true, "key": "opportunity_types", "label": "Opportunity Types", "updated_at": "2026-09-14T08:08:34.141659+00:00"}, {"created_at": "2026-09-16T03:12:11.6175+00:00", "description": "Verification badges a profile can apply for. metadata.description is the app's blurb.", "is_published": true, "key": "verification_types", "label": "Verification Types", "updated_at": "2026-09-16T03:12:11.6175+00:00"}, {"created_at": "2026-09-16T03:12:11.6175+00:00", "description": "Kinds of work added to a portfolio (Add work). metadata.app_key is the portfolio_items.kind the app writes; metadata.media is what the work carries.", "is_published": true, "key": "work_types", "label": "Work Types", "updated_at": "2026-09-16T03:12:11.6175+00:00"}, {"created_at": "2026-09-16T03:12:11.6175+00:00", "description": "Who can see your profile. metadata.app_key is the profiles.visibility value.", "is_published": true, "key": "profile_visibility", "label": "Profile Visibility", "updated_at": "2026-09-16T03:12:11.6175+00:00"}, {"created_at": "2026-09-16T03:12:11.6175+00:00", "description": "External links on a profile. metadata.app_key is the profiles.links key the app writes (absent when the app does not offer the platform yet); icon is a Simple Icons slug, brand_color its hex, placeholder an example URL.", "is_published": true, "key": "link_platforms", "label": "Link Platforms", "updated_at": "2026-09-16T03:12:11.6175+00:00"}, {"created_at": "2026-09-16T03:12:11.6175+00:00", "description": "What brings a person to MusicLinkd. metadata.app_key is the profiles.intents value the app writes.", "is_pu